      <activity id="0856f42f-2fb6-5d6b-93b9-09e20899ca54" activityNameId="7224a05d-57fc-572b-b749-70ae6089343a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Electricity, at wind power plant 2MW, offshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electricity, at wind power plant 2MW, offshore
The capacity factor is assumed to be 30 %, based on the electricity production of the offshore wind park Middelgrunden, Denmark. Gear oil has to be changed every second year. The lifetime of moving and fixed parts is assumed to be 20 resp. 40 years.;
UUID: 23f2cd16-32d3-3312-85c9-8095bfe6815c
Includes the operation of the wind power plant with the necessary change of gear oil. Also includes the capacity factor, concerning the wind conditions
Location: Data for a specific European offshore conditions. Can be used for regions with similar wind conditions. 
Technology: Technology of a specific 2 MW offshore wind power plant, representative for average European offshore conditions.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature and statistics. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_23f2cd16-32d3-3312-85c9-8095bfe6815c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
